  "abstract": "{\"id\":\"star.report.get\",\"title\":\"获取投后数据主题累计数据\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/star/report/custom_data_topic_report/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"capability_summary\":\"该接口用于获取星图各类型任务的投后累计数据，包括抖音短视频和直播的指派、招募、投稿任务。数据更新频率为每日16:00之后可查最新数据（不包括当天），单视频累计数据统计周期最长为45天，单直播累计数据统计周期为单场直播的累计数据。建议首次使用前先调用 /open_api/2/star/report/data_topic_config/ 接口了解具体数据主题下的Topic配置。\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"star.report.data_topic_config.get\",\"title\":\"获取数据主题配置\",\"path\":\"/open_api/2/star/report/data_topic_config/\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"reason\":\"建议首次使用前先调用此接口详细了解具体数据主题下的Topic配置\"},{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\",\"path\":\"\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"reason\":\"请求此接口需要通过该接口获取授权access_token\"}]}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-fC7GiDNU\" id=\"h346b9f0-fC7GiDNU\">使用说明</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-dJNele4s\">用于获数据主题对应指标取累计的数据的获取</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E7%9B%AE%E5%89%8D%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E3%80%8C%E6%8C%87%E6%B4%BE%E6%8A%96%E9%9F%B3%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E3%80%8D%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CbWLv%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-JefPA7fI%5C%22%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87%E8%BE%83%E5%A4%9A%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E6%8E%A5%E5%8F%A3%E8%B6%85%E6%97%B6%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%EF%BC%8C%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E5%8F%AF%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E8%B6%85%E5%87%BA1s%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JefPA7fI\">注意：数据指标较多，请注意调整接口超时时间，部分查询时间可能会超出1s。</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-4ZvEdAsL\">任务的作品对应指标若数据本身不存在，对应指标将缺省。如本身不存在<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">A3_ucnt</code>此指标，相应Metric将缺省。</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-H075930M\" id=\"h6f20189-H075930M\">覆盖任务范围</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-enIDLwkG\">此接口用于获取星图各类型任务的投后数据，包括：</p><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-PQk2aaZA\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-kW9Tclcl\">抖音-短视频-指派</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BOdRR2AG\">抖音-短视频-招募</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-a2Bn4CJ8\">抖音-短视频-投稿</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-W9NNUM4K\">抖音-直播-指派</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-bHlRpTMq\">抖音-直播-招募</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-2kTY0h1d\">抖音-直播-投稿</li></ol><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-44HRFDhj\" id=\"h6f20189-44HRFDhj\">数据更新频率</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ktd7bv51\">每日16:00 之后可查产出的最新数据（不包括当天）</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-dKJPOEdT\" id=\"h6f20189-KB7picQb\">数据统计周期</h3><ol data-id=\"ob7246f7-gOQEhf75\" start=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-aYhz9sAy\">单视频累计数据统计周期最长为45天，即视频发布当日+44天</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8P2TOjM2\">单直播累计数据统计周期为单场直播的累计数据</li></ol><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-bJNS1Cai\" id=\"h6f20189-bJNS1Cai\">主题域与投后报告映射关系</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table\" data