=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>json</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZZscpWJR\">json返回值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">item_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-08SoAi22\">请求的交付物Id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">demand_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SCRa6b87\">请求的任务Id</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 20px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-7N6gsJxI\">对应请求的数据主题数组</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data_topic</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-qrP7xfrq\">DataTopic，同请求中的数据主题枚举值。不存在的数据主题将缺省。 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-NfEAmmhg\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6OE5LimF\"><code>BASIC_DATA</code> 基础信息</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Rn01OP2H\"><code>COMMENT_DATA</code> 评论数据</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-JMaMRfkd\"><code>CONVERT_DATA</code> 转化表现</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-hI3CTfnk\"><code>DY_SHOP_DATA</code> 抖音进店</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-NjXBS3k3\"><code>FLOW_DATA</code> 流量表现</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-qIgL56UM\"><code>INDEX_SCORE_DATA</code> 指数得分</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SRNYIm88\"><code>RECOMMEND_DATA</code> 种草表现</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4QTbeYoH\"><code>SEARCH_DATA</code> 搜索表现</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-deC20lhX\"><code>USER_DISTRIBUTION_DATA</code> 用户画像：<strong>直播用户画像仅保留近90天且直播时长 &gt;= 25 分钟直播数据</strong></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"2\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 48px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 36px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">metrics</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rZLKlMfe\">数据主题下的数据指标，一个数据主题对应一个或多个数据指标。不存在的数据指标将缺省。</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">field</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YAdRPIEF\">指标字段，仅包含英文与下划线等符号</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">name</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WSyeVLgM\">指标名称，中文或英文描述字段名称</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9HFFXIkg\">指标数据类型：\nSTRING、\nINT64、\nFLOAT64、\nJSON格式字符串为K-V键值对，如画像部分数据: {\"长沙\": 0.24} 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-JanHacMI\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-7J5dtC8f\"><code>FLOAT64</code> 64位浮点数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Pro72qPN\"><code>INT64</code> 64位整数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6VfYJJgi\"><code>JSON</code> JSON</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-4pc99uYg\"><code>STRING</code> 字符串</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">value</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-SSWYz06t\">指标值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"3\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 64px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">description</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eFzTJruu\">指标描述，建议首次使用前先调用/open_api/2/star/report/data_topic_config/接口详细了解具体数据主题下的Topic配置</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">request_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-1ZGVBOFp\">请求日志id</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-h11lVYRS\" id=\"h346b9f0-h11lVYRS\">应答示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22disabled%22%3Atrue%2C%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22HTTPS%2F1.1%20200%20OK%5Cn%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22message%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22OK%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22code%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22data%5C%22%3A%20%7B%7D%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22EFz6t%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content json\"></div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"qz-error-code_v2\" data-type=\"qzerrorcode\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201791940630846532%7D\">\n \n</div>\n</div>",
